break-word">
<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">Good Afternoon<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">Thank you for meeting with us on 16<sup>th</sup> Octo=
ber 2025 regarding Bridget Walker&#8217;s invoices.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">Please accept my apologies for the delay in replying.=
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">Hopefully, you will have received a letter from the D=
WP regarding the higher rate of Attendance Allowance.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">I attach the original invoices that were issued prior=
 to the Deferred Payment being set up and the credit note issued on 19<sup>=
th</sup> June 2023.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">The 16<sup>th</sup> March 2023 Invoice had the 12-wee=
k disregard period from 27<sup>th</sup> September 2022 to 19<sup>th</sup> D=
ecember 2022 the charges of =A34061.35 are correct.
 The period 20<sup>th</sup> December 2022 to 5<sup>th</sup> March 2023 you =
were charged the =A3800.00 per week =A38,685.71 however, when the credit no=
te was issued it reduced this amount by =A3389.77 per week and the credit n=
ote for this period is =A34231.19. Therefore
 the total amount due on this Invoice was =A38515.87.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">The 14<sup>th</sup> April 2024 Invoice for a 4-week p=
eriod 6<sup>th</sup> April 2023 to 2<sup>nd</sup> April 2023 the credit not=
e reduced this period by =A31559.08, therefore =A31640.92
 was due.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">The 17<sup>th</sup> May 2023 for the period 3<sup>rd<=
/sup> April 2023 to 30<sup>th</sup> April 2023 this reflected the change in=
 care homes and the uplift of charges at Westcliff
 Lodge the credit note reduced the invoice by =A31408.85 to =A31659.37<o:p>=
</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">The weekly amounts Deferred for each Care Home are as=
 follows<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">Westcliff Lodge =A3389.77 when Care Home Cost was =A3=
800.00<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">Palmerston Care Home =A3386.30 when Care Home Cost =
=A3750.00<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">Palmerston Care Home =A3415.90 when Care Home Cost =
=A3800.03<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">Palmerston Care Home =A3449.27 when Care Home Cost =
=A3844.83<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
ial&quot;,sans-serif">If you need any further information or would like to =
meet again to discuss this, please do not hesitate to contact me.<o:p></o:p=
></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ar=
